        Luth: Efficient French Specialization for Small <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> and Cross-Lingual Transfer
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lasbordes%2C+M">Maxence Lasbordes</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gad%2C+S">Sinoué Gad</a>
      
