        Universal Neural Architecture Space: Covering ConvNets, <span class="search-hit mathjax">Transformers</span> and Everything in Between
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=T%C3%BDbl%2C+O">Ondřej Týbl</a>, 
      
