        Distributional Semantics Tracing: A Framework for Explaining Hallucinations in Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bhatia%2C+G">Gagan Bhatia</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sripada%2C+S+G">Somayajulu G Sripada</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Allan%2C+K">Kevin Allan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Azcona%2C+J">Jacobo Azcona</a>
      
