    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Relational <span class="search-hit mathjax">Transformer</span>: Toward Zero-Shot <span class="search-hit mathjax">Foundation</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> for Relational Data
      
