        A Comparative Analysis of Contextual Representation Flow in State-Space and <span class="search-hit mathjax">Transformer</span> Architectures
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
